{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_131_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_131","textTraditional":"一、十有七年，春，王正月，庚子，許男錫我卒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_131_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_131","textTraditional":"二、丁未，蔡侯申卒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_131_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_131","textTraditional":"三、夏，葬許昭公。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_131_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_131","textTraditional":"四、葬蔡文公。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_131_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_131","textTraditional":"五、六月，癸卯，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_131_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_131","textTraditional":"六、己未，公會晉侯、衞侯、曹伯、邾子，同盟於斷道。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_131_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_131","textTraditional":"同者，有同也，同外楚也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_131_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_131","textTraditional":"七、秋，公至自會。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_131_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_131","textTraditional":"八、冬，十有一月，壬午，公弟叔肸卒。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_131_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_131","textTraditional":"其曰公弟叔肸，賢之也。其賢之何也？宣弒而非之也。非之則胡為不去也？曰「兄弟也，何去而之？」與之財，則曰：「我足矣。」織屨而食，終身不食宣公之食。君子以是為通恩也，以取貴乎春秋。","sentenceOrder":10}],"overrides":{}}